title=Airbrush+for+Miniatures%3A+Beginner+Setup+and+First+Paints&slug=airbrush-for-beginners&content=%3Ch1%3EAirbrush+for+Miniatures%3A+Beginner+Setup+and+First+Paints%3C%2Fh1%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShort+answer%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Start+with+a+dual-action%2C+gravity-feed+airbrush+and+a+small+compressor+with+a+tank+%28around+%24100%E2%80%93150+total%29.+Thin+your+paints+to+milk+consistency%2C+spray+at+15%E2%80%9325+PSI%2C+and+learn+priming%2C+basecoating+and+zenithal+highlighting+before+anything+fancy.+Clean+the+airbrush+after+every+session+%E2%80%94+maintenance+is+the+whole+skill.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EDisclosure%3A+Some+links+on+this+page+are+affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+if+you+buy+through+them%2C+we+may+earn+a+small+commission+at+no+extra+cost+to+you.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EChoosing+Your+First+Compressor+and+Airbrush%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ECompressor+%E2%80%94+buy+one+with+a+tank.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+A+tank+smooths+pulsation+and+lets+the+motor+rest%3B+it%27s+the+difference+between+a+calm+tool+and+a+spitting+hose.+Noise+matters+if+you+paint+at+home+in+the+evening.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EAirbrush+%E2%80%94+dual-action%2C+gravity-feed%2C+0.3+mm+nozzle.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cem%3EDual-action%3C%2Fem%3E+means+air+and+paint+are+controlled+separately+%28press+down+%3D+air%2C+pull+back+%3D+paint%29.+Single-action+brushes+teach+bad+habits%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cem%3EGravity-feed%3C%2Fem%3E+%28cup+on+top%29+wastes+less+paint+than+siphon+styles%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cem%3E0.3+mm%3C%2Fem%3E+handles+both+priming+and+detail%3B+0.5+mm+is+for+terrain+and+basecoats%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3ESkip+the+%2430+%22airbrush+kits%22+from+marketplace+sites+%E2%80%94+their+compressors+lack+tanks+and+their+brushes+clog.+A+solid+beginner+setup+is+two+steps+up+and+lasts+years.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EThinning+Paints+and+PSI+Pressure+Guide%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EThin+to+milk+consistency%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+the+paint+should+flow+off+a+stirring+stick+like+whole+milk.+Airbrush+thinner+or+distilled+water+both+work%3B+flow+improver+helps%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPSI+guide%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+primer+20%E2%80%9325+PSI+%C2%B7+basecoat+20%E2%80%9325+PSI+%C2%B7+glazes+and+fades+10%E2%80%9315+PSI+%C2%B7+Zenithal+highlights+25%E2%80%9330+PSI%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EWhen+in+doubt%2C+thin+more+and+add+a+second+pass+%E2%80%94+wet+lines+and+spider+webs+mean+too+thick%2C+spatter+means+too+thin+or+too+much+pressure%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EThe+First+Three+Skills+%28in+order%29%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPriming%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+even+dark+grey+coats+at+15+cm+distance.+Rotate+the+model%3B+two+thin+passes+beat+one+wet+one%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EBasecoating%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+paint+a+whole+squad+in+one+colour+session.+This+is+where+the+airbrush+pays+for+itself+%E2%80%94+20+models+in+30+minutes%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EZenithal+highlighting%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+spray+white+from+directly+above+at+30%E2%80%9345%C2%B0.+Everything+below+stays+shadowed+%E2%80%94+then+thin+translucent+colour+over+it+produces+instant+light+logic.+The+single+most+valuable+airbrush+technique%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ECleaning+and+Maintenance+Routine%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EAfter+every+session%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+spray+cleaner+through%2C+back-flush+%28cover+the+nozzle+with+a+cloth+and+press+air%29%2C+wipe+the+needle%2C+one+drop+of+lubricant%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EWeekly+%28or+when+it+splutters%29%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+remove+the+nozzle+and+needle%2C+soak+in+cleaner%2C+reassemble+carefully%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ENever+let+paint+dry+in+the+cup%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+dried+paint+in+the+nozzle+is+the+number-one+airbrush+killer%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EKeep+spare+nozzles+and+needles+%E2%80%94+they+bend%2C+and+that%27s+normal%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ERecommended+Beginner+Bundles%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EItem%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EWhy%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EPriority%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ECompressor+with+tank%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EStable%2C+quiet%2C+motor+lasts%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBuy+first%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EDual-action+gravity+brush+%280.3+mm%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EThe+all-rounder%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBuy+first%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EAirbrush+thinner+%2B+flow+improver%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EConsistency+control%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBuy+first%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ECleaning+solution+%2B+spare+nozzle%2Fneedle+kit%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EMaintenance+survival+kit%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBuy+immediately%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ESpray+booth%2Ffilter%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EIndoor+painting+without+painting+the+room%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ESecond+month%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3E%28Affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+buying+through+them+supports+the+workbench.%29%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFAQ%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIs+an+airbrush+worth+it+for+a+beginner%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EIf+you%27ll+paint+armies+%28not+single+display+models%29%2C+absolutely%3A+priming+and+basecoating+speed+alone+saves+dozens+of+hours.+Learn+brush+fundamentals+in+parallel.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDo+I+need+special+paint+for+airbrushing%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ENo+%E2%80%94+standard+acrylics+work+when+thinned+properly.+Pre-thinned+airbrush+lines+are+convenient+but+cost+more+per+millilitre.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+messy+is+airbrushing%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EContainable%3A+low+PSI%2C+close+distance+and+a+cheap+spray+booth+or+a+cardboard+box+keep+overspray+manageable.+Ventilation+matters+for+health%2C+not+tidiness.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat+PSI+for+priming+miniatures%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E20%E2%80%9325+PSI+from+12%E2%80%9315+cm+distance%2C+in+light+passes.+Wet+primer+hides+detail+and+runs+into+recesses.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EContinue+on+the+Workbench%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Fbest-hobby-tools%2F%22%3EBest+Hobby+Tools+for+Miniature+Painting%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+brush-side+trinity%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Fobject-source-lighting%2F%22%3EObject+Source+Lighting%3A+Simple+OSL+Guide%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+airbrush+%2B+glazes+%3D+fast+OSL%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2F3d-printed-terrain%2F%22%3E3D+Printed+Terrain+for+Tabletop+Games%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+where+the+0.5+mm+brush+earns+its+keep%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fhow-to-start-warhammer-40k%2F%22%3EHow+to+Start+Warhammer+40K%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+when+in+your+first+30+days+to+add+an+airbrush%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe+airbrush+is+a+maintenance+habit%2C+not+a+purchase.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Clean+it+every+session+and+it+outlives+every+other+tool+on+your+desk.+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fshop%2Fairbrush%2F%22%3EShop+beginner+airbrush+setups+%E2%86%92%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%3Cem%3E%28affiliate+links%29%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E&status=publish